%SIXMD 1
# @?UNMOUNT - UNMOUNT A FILESYSTEM

## @?OPERANDS

### @?TARGET
CURRENT MOUNT POINT TO DETACH.

## DESCRIPTION

UNMOUNT DETACHES THE FILESYSTEM MOUNTED ON TARGET.
USAGE IS 'UNMOUNT TARGET'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
